NAME
    dial - open a TCP connection out of another machine's NIC

SYNOPSIS
    dial <base> <ip> <port> [request...]

DESCRIPTION
    Connects to <ip>:<port> through the network interface of the machine
    remote-mounted at <base>, optionally sending [request] and printing the
    reply. The Plan 9 /net/tcp connection model. Cluster feature.

SEE ALSO
    serve, fetch, mount
